<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 08.132  PaolOtto Rectangular Cushion</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Design by: Ottorino Invernizzi</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">6-12-2012</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="284">Angles for R.I. = 1.540</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="302">85 facets + 24 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">2-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">L/W = 1.150  T/W = 0.671  U/W = 0.496</tspan>
